            "text": "Native form controls must preserve Chromium's platform-theme paint instead of sharing one synthetic geometry table. Blink delegates appearance:auto chrome to OS-specific LayoutTheme/native shadow parts, so rasterizing only that host is the general cross-platform rule; appearance:none remains vector and author-controlled.",
